cott-colom-defeats-republican-cindy-hyde-smith/a-79924938--fc149241f06d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mississippi-senate-race-democrat-scott-colom-defeats-republican-cindy-hyde-smith/a-79924938?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The southern US state of Mississippi has elected its first Black senator in more than 140 years. Democrat Scott Colom has won the seat in a historic upset, according to projections.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian Foreign Ministry says its ambassador to US has died</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bde94fa9f9f8085a7b41d4c457dad8933d5569a45c62446f8113f47a4ddbcc8a</id><updated>2026-11-12T07:27:26Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T23:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-foreign-ministry-says-its-ambassador-to-us-has-died/a-79924829--521886c8847c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-foreign-ministry-says-its-ambassador-to-us-has-died/a-79924829?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russia's Foreign Ministry has said that Alexander Darchiev died from a chronic illness at the age of 66. The long-time diplomat had been in the Washington post since early 2025.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Spain: Housing crisis prompts general strike, mass nighttime protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b318487efa82dbc325ed3b62b4ada15a817d4d6071dda41b6cac0bbc16542f3f</id><updated>2026-11-12T07:26:07Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T21:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-housing-crisis-prompts-general-strike-mass-nighttime-protests/a-79915208--fc6d9d65a508.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-housing-crisis-prompts-general-strike-mass-nighttime-protests/a-79915208?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hundreds of thousands of citizens have hit the streets to 